hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"217","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaybah bin Sa'eed, qala: haddasana Ibn Abi Fudayk, 'an 'Abdillah bin Muslim bin Jundub, 'an abihi, 'an Ibn 'Umar, qala: qala Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: teen cheezein radd nahi ki jatin: wasayid, aur roghan, aur doodh."
"218","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmood bin Ghaylan, qala: haddasana Abu Dawud Al-Hafari, 'an Sufyan, 'an Al-Jurayri, 'an Abi Nadrah, 'an rajul, 'an Abi Hurayrah, qala: qala Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: mardon ka ittr wo hai jis ki khushbu zahir ho aur rang chhupa ho, aur aurton ka ittr wo hai jis ka rang zahir ho aur khushbu chhupi ho. Haddasana Ali bin Hujr, qala: anba'ana Isma'il bin Ibrahim, 'an Al-Jurayri, 'an Abi Nadrah, 'an Al-Tufawi, 'an Abi Hurayrah, 'an An-Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, mithlahu bi ma'nah (is jaisa matlab mein)."
"219","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmood bin Ghaylan, qala: haddasana Abu Dawud Al-Hafari, 'an Sufyan, 'an Al-Jurayri, 'an Abi Nadrah, 'an rajul, 'an Abi Hurayrah, qala: qala Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: mardon ka ittr wo hai jis ki khushbu zahir ho aur rang chhupa ho, aur aurton ka ittr wo hai jis ka rang zahir ho aur khushbu chhupi ho. Haddasana Ali bin Hujr, qala: anba'ana Isma'il bin Ibrahim, 'an Al-Jurayri, 'an Abi Nadrah, 'an Al-Tufawi, 'an Abi Hurayrah, 'an An-Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, mithlahu bi ma'nah (is jaisa matlab mein)."
